OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed after 'campaign of
OL,4,Aviolence'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains
OL,7,Fdistressing details of violence
OL,9,FA "dangerous" man who carried out a
OL,10,F"campaign of violence" and subjected a
OL,11,Fwoman to years of physical and sexual
OL,12,Fabuse has been jailed for 19 years.
OL,14,FMartin Lloyd, 39, attacked the woman
OL,15,Fwith weapons including a machete,
OL,16,Fchains and a baseball bat resulting in
OL,17,Fa broken nose and leg injuries, West
OL,18,FMidlands Police said.
